-    fn fermat_little_theorem() {
-        // F_{2^8}\{0} has order 255, so a^{255} = 1 for every nonzero a.
-        // Strong structural check: catches any single-bit error in the
-        // reduction logic, since wrong reduction breaks the cyclic group.
