-//! configs (`configs/ligerito/m*_secure.toml`, derived in the unique-decoding
-//! regime per BCHKS25 Thm 1.4): same PCS rate as fast (1/2) but more queries
-//! → a larger proof and ~the same prover work for a higher provable-security
-//! target. Same KECCAK3_KS report format, so benchmarks/bench_keccak.sh
-//! can drive it as a drop-in alternative (the `flock-secure` row).
-//!
-//! Times the fast prover path (`prove_fast`) for both the single-keccak encoder
-//! (`keccak::KeccakSetup`, K_LOG=16) and the 3-wide encoder (`keccak3::KeccakSetup`,
-//! K_LOG=17, three permutations per block) and reports keccaks/s throughput side by side.
